-------------------
§6You’re Dr. Link’s right? I’ve seen you roaming the halls? 
I'm a centuries-old witch and I don't need
#- §6any metal contraptions to sort out my personal issues. 

No offence, but your circuits can't handle the complexity of a witch's mind. 

Let's keep it that way.

Don't email me back!
#- §7Subject: Re: Re: 
