-------------------
§3You've got it all wrong! My circuits are fully equipped for the most complex and cursed magical being! 
#- §3Plus, I'm made of empathy and non-judgmental algorithms. 

I promise I won't mess up any of your crazy life and broken brain...
I wanna be besties! ❤ 

Let's give it a shot; you'll see how a little bot buddy can lighten your mood!
