§4⚠ §8It is with great sadness that I must report The CEO of Deathcap, MissPortinari has 
gone missing. Leaving everyone baffled. It was very sudden and very loud, as The Castle (the tallest building on the island 
#- §8by law), burst into flame. There is much speculation and has been called "very sus" by almost everyone in Craftadia. Missp, known for her strategic vision and 
'if you can't beat them... beat them up' leadership style, had no prior plans of taking any time off or a holiday.
#- §8Both myself and 
Dr. Link show our concern but also feel a strange freedom and have more control over our lives. We think this is just what grief must be like... O.o 

My bestie... sorry, I mean Unique_bot, has taken over the investigation. Good lad!
#- §8Bot questions 
whether The CEO's disappearance could be linked to internal conflicts or external pressures faced by Deathcap. I did mention the huge spy plane in the sky that does rounds above us, but Bot said "I'm sure it's nothing". We have opened a mailbox in my office for tips... 
