§cAh, /warp irc, at first glance, a blackstone office tower at the South East corner of Deathcap Isle that is wedged between the epic erieness of /warp cthulu, the colorful crops of a micro public custom
#- §ccrop farm, and Central Park. As we enter we can look up and see a 'Guardian PolarBear' keeping watch above, passing through the door we hear the ding of chimes and music and find a store small in footprint but large in shops! The store seems to be designed to lose money...§r
#- §c...as it focuses more on buying than selling! 
Industrious souls will find they can sell all the crops from the farm outside right here, the farm also providing items for quick use of same. Back inside we see it also buys most regular crops with an obvious lack of§r  
#- §cmelons and gourds. Looking to the South we see a wall dedicated to purchasing ore blocks and providing mining supplies like potions and silk picks. Exiting the main store to the south we find ourselves on a loading dock with a beautiful view of the majestic ice peaks§r
#- §cof the isle area. This pier aka /warp lumber seems soley to exist to buy classic logs from players. There is a sponge "rental" and a boat dock. 

Walking down to the docked boat we see that the shop owner lives on same and rumor has it...§r 
#- §che can be frequently seen fishing from its deck.

